Janus

This package contains data derived from the Unicode Character Database, version
17.0.0, copyright 1991-2026 Unicode, Inc., distributed under the Unicode License
v3. The files are vendored under tools/Janus.UnicodeTables/ucd/ together with the
licence text, and the tables generated from them are in src/Janus.Core/Unicode/.

This package contains the offline leaked-password list: the 100,000 most prevalent
SHA-1 hashes of Pwned Passwords, from Have I Been Pwned (https://haveibeenpwned.com),
drawn on 2026-09-26 over the range API. The list is in
src/Janus.Hosting/Passwords/leaked-passwords.txt, and tools/leaked-passwords/draw.py
draws it.
